    <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
    <p style="color:var(--ink-soft);">Last updated: October 2026</p>
    <h2>What Are Cookies?</h2>
    <p>Cookies are small files stored by a website in a visitor's browser. Similar technologies, including browser local storage, may also be used to remember preferences or support website functionality.</p>
    <h2>How GoOrganicAfrica Uses Browser Storage</h2>
    <p>The website may use local storage or cookies for functional purposes such as remembering preferences, supporting the calculator and maintaining a reliable user experience.</p>
    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>If Google Analytics or another analytics service is enabled, that service may use cookies or similar technologies to measure visits, page usage and website performance. The applicable privacy information of the service provider also applies.</p>
    <h2>Advertising</h2>
    <p>If Google AdSense or another advertising service is enabled, advertising providers may use cookies or similar technologies to deliver, measure and personalise advertising subject to applicable settings, consent requirements and provider policies.</p>
    <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
    <p>Links or integrations with services such as WhatsApp, Selar, Google services and other third-party providers may take visitors to systems that use their own cookies and privacy technologies.</p>
    <h2>Managing Cookies</h2>
    <p>You can manage or delete cookies through your browser settings. Blocking functional storage may cause some website features to work differently.</p>
    <h2>More Information</h2>
    <p>For broader information about personal data and third-party processing, see our <a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
